{"path":"experimental/optional/value","title":"std::experimental::optional<T>::value","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::optional&lt;T&gt;::</span>value","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/optional/value","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the contained value.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> value<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> value<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> value<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> value<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the contained value.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Equivalent